{#- SegmentedControl({ label, name, value, size: sm, form, options: [{ value, text, icon, count, href }] }) — one of a few views. With hrefs it is links; otherwise radio-like buttons that submit name=value without a script, and <au-segmented> switches them in place (a hidden input keeps the value; `change` fires on it). -#}
{% macro SegmentedControl(p) -%}
  {%- set __html %}{% include "./template.njk" %}{% endset -%}
  {{- __html | trim | safe -}}
{%- endmacro %}
